r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 103.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"138\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Truncating, frameshift, missense</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DNA repair, postreplication repair or a cell-cycle checkpoint function, interstrand DNA crosslink repair and in maintenance of normal chromosome stability; others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colon, thyroid, gastric, and intestinal neoplasms; hepatoblastoma; desmoid tumours; medulloblastoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Familial AML</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>RUNX1</em>, others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">601626</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 61.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"82\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">21q22.12</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 103.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"138\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Point mutations</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Transcription factor involved in the generation and differentiation of haematopoietic stem cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Leukaemia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Familial paraganglioma phaeochromocytoma syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>SDHB</em>, <em>SDHAF2</em>, <em>SDHC</em>, <em>SDHD</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">115310, others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 61.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"82\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">1p36.13, others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 103.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"138\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Splice-site, frameshift, nonsense</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Complex&nbsp;II of the respiratory chain specifically involved in the oxidation of succinate; others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Paraganglioma, phaeochromocytoma, neuroblastoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>TP53</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">151623</p>\r\n</td>